@startuml
title Update client profile

actor Client
participant "NGINX" as NGINX
participant "FE (Next.js client)" as FE
participant "BE (Django/DRF)" as BE
database "DB (PostgreSQL)" as DB

Client -> FE : open /perfil (prefilled from /auth/me)
note over FE
  ProfileForm (React Hook Form) — msisdn read-only.
  Editable: first/last name, email, birthday, preferred_channel.
end note

Client -> FE : edit + submit
FE -> NGINX : PATCH /v1/profile/  (X-CSRFToken)
NGINX -> BE : proxy
note over BE
  AuthN: session cookie; AuthZ: role = client (IsClient)
  users.serializers.ClientProfileUpdateSerializer (partial)
  - email format; preferred_channel in {whatsapp, sms, email}
  - msisdn NOT editable here (contact change via staff)
end note
BE -> BE : users.services.update_client_profile()
BE -> DB : UPDATE users_user (own row)
BE --> FE : 200 (UserSerializer incl. birthday)
FE -> FE : update /auth/me cache (TanStack Query)
FE --> Client : "Perfil atualizado"
@enduml
